# ── Optional client overrides (Vite build-time) ─────────────────────────────
# VITE_WORKER_URL: base URL of the Workers backend (no trailing slash).
#
# You normally DON'T need this:
#   - npm run dev        → the client defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8787
#                          (the local wrangler dev worker)
#   - production builds  → the client connects same-origin (the deployed
#                          Worker serves both the site and the API)
#
# Set it only for unusual splits, e.g. pointing a locally served client at a
# deployed backend, or hosting the static build somewhere other than the
# Worker. Copy this file to `.env` to use it.
#VITE_WORKER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
